@startuml
title C4 Level 1 – System Context (Resources) – Azure CIAM Architecture

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

cloud "Azure Entra CIAM\n(Hosted Login + Token Issuer)" as CIAM
cloud "Microsoft Graph API" as Graph

rectangle "Port Management System" as PMS {
    rectangle "Resources API\n(ASP.NET Core WebApp)" as API
}

database "Azure SQL Database\n(Resources, Qualifications, etc.)" as SQL


Operator --> CIAM : Login (OAuth2 / OIDC)
Manager --> CIAM : Login\n(OAuth2 / OIDC)

CIAM --> Operator : ID Token + Access Token
CIAM --> Manager : ID Token + Access Token

Operator --> API : HTTPS + Bearer Token\n(manage resources)
Manager --> API : HTTPS + Bearer Token\n(maintenance, activation)

API --> SQL : EF Core\nCRUD operations

API --> Graph : Get user metadata,\nroles, groups
@enduml
